            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A handheld vaping device configured to work with a non-user re-fillable combined atomiser and liquid reservoir (or 'pod') (2) that is attachable to, and removable from, a main body of the device (10) and that is supplied to an end-user pre-filled with liquid. The handheld vaping device is also configured to work with a user re-fillable combined atomiser and liquid reservoir (or 'pod') (11) that is attachable to, and removable from, the main body of the device (10) and that is configured to be automatically fillable with liquid multiple times using a fluid transfer system.</p>
